# State, plans, values and logs never enter the repository (infra/README.md "Running a plan locally").
# This list is a convenience: .github/scripts/infra_guard.py allows only the committed file kinds
# (ALLOWED_FILES) and fails on anything else under infra/, whatever its name.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
# Plans hold every value in plain text, sensitive variables included.
tfplan
tfplan.*
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.*
plan
plan.*
*.plan
*.out
*.json
*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!local.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
# OpenTofu loads these too; infra/ uses *.tf only.
*.tofu
*.tofu.json
*.tf.json
override.tf
*_override.tf
